application CExports.

operation Add:
    accepts a of type i64.
    accepts b of type i64.
    returns i64.
    exports "C" as "sal_add".
    body:
        return a + b.

operation Equal:
    accepts a of type i64.
    accepts b of type i64.
    returns bool.
    exports "C" as "sal_equal".
    body:
        return a == b.
